      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense, but I want to dig deeper into the District 2 risk factors. You mentioned the non-English speaking aspect and the \"immigrant hub\" context. When modeling the spread, should we account for specific cultural habits or hygiene practices that are common in these types of communities that might accelerate the spread more than just the density or the job types?",
